3. Add name Properties to application.yml
Because NameProperties uses @ConfigurationProperties(prefix = "name", ignoreUnknownFields = false), add this section to application.yml with your exact prefixes/suffixes:
name:
  mms-max-age-days: 5
  mms-filename-prefix: "MMS-RES-"
  mms-filename-suffix: ".zip"
  create-filename-prefix: "MMS-CREATE-"
  amend-filesname-prefix: "MMS-AMEND-"
  cancel-filesname-prefix: "MMS-CANCEL-"
  mandate-postfix: "-INP-ACK.zip"

(Keep amend-filesname-prefix and cancel-filesname-prefix spelled with filesname so they bind to amendFilesnamePrefix and cancelFilesnamePrefix in NameProperties.)
